# COMPONENT

## ToolchainRunner

### PACKAGE

org.simplemodeling.textus.toolchainrunner

### DESCRIPTION

Textus component that owns the Textus toolchain Docker image and exposes it as
artifact conversion operations. The component does not own a specific artifact
domain; it runs installed toolchain commands in a controlled Docker workspace.

# DATATYPE

## ToolchainFailureKind

Classifies a failed artifact conversion. `invalid-input` means the operation
input cannot identify a usable artifact. `execution-failed` means the
configured toolchain command failed or did not produce the requested output.

### ATTRIBUTE

| name  | type   | multiplicity | max-length | pattern              |
|-------+--------+--------------+------------+----------------------|
| value | string | 1            | 16         | pass:[^[a-z-]+$]     |

# VALUE

## ToolchainArtifactResult

### EXTENDS

OperationResult

### ATTRIBUTE

| name         | type    | multiplicity |
|--------------+---------+--------------|
| valid        | boolean | 1            |
| errorCount   | int     | 1            |
| warningCount | int     | 1            |
| message      | string  | 1            |
| failureKind  | ToolchainFailureKind | ? |
| out          | string  | 1            |
| pageCount    | int     | 1            |
| dockerImage  | string  | 1            |

# SERVICE

## Toolchain

### DESCRIPTION

Operations for converting and inspecting generated artifacts through the Textus
toolchain Docker image.

### OPERATION

#### convertSvgToPdf

Converts one SVG file to one PDF file by running the `svg-pages-to-pdf`
toolchain command inside the Textus toolchain Docker image.

##### TYPE

QUERY

##### INPUT

###### VALUE

####### ConvertSvgToPdfQuery

######## EXTENDS

QueryAction

######## ATTRIBUTE

| name          | type   | multiplicity |
|---------------+--------+--------------|
| svg           | string | 1            |
| out           | string | ?            |
| dockerImage   | string | ?            |
| dockerCommand | string | ?            |
| workDir       | string | ?            |

##### OUTPUT

###### TYPE

ToolchainArtifactResult

#### convertSvgPagesToPdf

Converts multiple SVG files to a single multi-page PDF by running the
`svg-pages-to-pdf` toolchain command inside the Textus toolchain Docker image.

##### TYPE

QUERY

##### INPUT

###### VALUE

####### ConvertSvgPagesToPdfQuery

######## EXTENDS

QueryAction

######## ATTRIBUTE

| name          | type   | multiplicity |
|---------------+--------+--------------|
| svgFiles      | string | 1            |
| out           | string | ?            |
| dockerImage   | string | ?            |
| dockerCommand | string | ?            |
| workDir       | string | ?            |

##### OUTPUT

###### TYPE

ToolchainArtifactResult

#### renderWebPage

Renders one JavaScript-driven Web page with the browser runtime in the Textus
toolchain image. The request and response payloads are exchanged through files
so URLs and rendered HTML do not appear in process arguments or stdout.

##### TYPE

QUERY

##### INPUT

###### VALUE

####### RenderWebPageQuery

######## EXTENDS

QueryAction

######## ATTRIBUTE

| name            | type   | multiplicity |
|-----------------+--------+--------------|
| url             | string | 1            |
| waitUntil       | string | ?            |
| waitForSelector | string | ?            |
| timeoutSeconds  | int    | ?            |
| userAgent       | string | ?            |
| browserProfile  | string | ?            |
| dockerImage     | string | ?            |
| dockerCommand   | string | ?            |
| workDir         | string | ?            |

##### OUTPUT

###### VALUE

####### RenderedWebPageResult

######## EXTENDS

OperationResult

######## ATTRIBUTE

| name         | type   | multiplicity | confidentiality |
|--------------+--------+--------------+-----------------|
| requestedUrl | string | 1            |                 |
| finalUrl     | string | 1            |                 |
| status       | int    | ?            |                 |
| title        | string | ?            |                 |
| html         | string | 1            | sensitive       |
| renderedAt   | string | 1            |                 |
| engine       | string | 1            |                 |
| browser      | string | 1            |                 |
